{"type":"message","id":"e885e510","parentId":"856c3414","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:34:36.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Turn Analysis Report\n\n### 1. Turn Count Breakdown\n\n**Total: 19 LLM turns**\n\n| Turn | Tool | Action |\n|------|------|--------|\n| 1 | `exec` | Claim feed job |\n| 2 | `exec` | Init run + source env |\n| 3 | `exec` | Persist batch manifest |\n| 4 | `exec` | Build picker input |\n| 5 | `sessions_spawn` | Spawn picker |\n| 6 | `sessions_yield` | Wait for picker |\n| 7 | (completion) | Picker done |\n| 8 | `exec` | Validate picks |\n| 9 | `exec` | Display pick summary |\n| 10 | `exec` | Switch iteration + update status |\n| 11 | `sessions_spawn` | Spawn researcher |\n| 12 | `sessions_yield` | Wait for researcher |\n| 13 | (completion) | Researcher done |\n| 14 | `exec` | Validate research + topic check + register + artifacts + manifest + pick status |\n| 15 | `sessions_spawn` | Spawn writer |\n| 16 | `sessions_yield` | Wait for writer |\n| 17 | (completion) | Writer done |\n| 18-23 | `exec` (chain) | Sync + check + post-artifacts + update manifest |\n| 24-26 | `exec` | Creator input + spawn + yield |\n| 27 | (completion) | Creator done |\n| 28-35 | `exec` (chain) | Drive upload + WP publish + cards + cleanup |\n\n### 2. Compound Execution Opportunities\n\n**Major wins:**\n\n| Sequence | Turns | Better: 1 compound |\n|----------|-------|-------------------|\n| Init (claim → init_run → manifest → picker_input) | 4 | Could be 1 script |\n| Post-research validation (validate → topic_check → register → artifacts → manifest → pick_status) | 1 turn (already chained) ✓ | — |\n| Post-writer validation (pre_sync → sync → check → post_sync → manifest) | 5 turns | Could be 1 compound |\n| Post-WP cleanup (update_recent → manifest → tokens → card → pick_status) | 5 turns | Could be 1 compound |\n\n**Estimated savings: ~8 turns** if script-chained properly.\n\n### 3. Subagent Handoff & Retry Friction\n\n| Agent | Retries? | Reason |\n|-------|----------|--------|\n| picker | No | SUCCESS on first run |\n| researcher | No | RESEARCH_VALID on first run |\n| writer | No | ARTICLE_CHECK: PASS on first run |\n| creator | No | Image path returned on first run |\n\n**Zero retry friction** — all agents passed validation first attempt.\n\n### 4. File Path & Variable Resolution Errors\n\n| Issue | Cause | Turn Lost |\n|-------|-------|-----------|\n| `primary_headline` KeyError | Wrong field name in pick display | 1 (fixed with fallback) |\n| `--classify-only` flag missed | Not included in first validate_picks call | 0 (caught before call) |\n| `build_and_send_card.py` unknown args | Script doesn't accept `--project` / `--chat-id` | 1 |\n| `update_pick_status` JSON-in-arg failure | `--tokens-by-model` JSON truncated badly | 1 |\n\n**Total: 3 lost turns** to argument/schema mismatches.\n\n### 5. Top 3 Turn-Reduction Recommendations\n\n1. **Create `run_feed_drain_story.sh` wrapper**\n   - Chains: claim → init_run → manifest → picker_input → spawn picker\n   - Chains all post-research validation into one block\n   - Chains all post-writer validation into one block\n   - Chains WP publish → card → cleanup into one block\n   - **Saves: ~6 turns**\n\n2. **Fix script argument contracts**\n   - `build_and_send_card.py`: read project/chat from manifest (already knows `RUN_DIR`)\n   - `update_pick_status.py`: accept `--tokens-json-file` instead of inline JSON\n   - **Saves: 2 turns**\n\n3. **Merge `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` into single turn**\n   - Current: spawn turn → yield turn → completion turn = 3 turns per agent\n   - Better: spawn with inline `await` semantics (if OpenClaw supports it)\n   - Alternative: orchestration script that calls subagents sequentially in background\n   - **Saves: 4 turns** (picker, researcher, writer, creator)\n\n**Target: 7 turns** (claim/init → picker spawn → researcher spawn → writer spawn → creator spawn → WP/publish → report)"}],"api":"openai-completions"